{"title":"关于印发《东莞市建筑工程BIM技术应用指南（试行）》的通知","date":"2024-12-02","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:17.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">关于印发《东莞市建筑工程<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术应用指南（试行）》</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:17.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">的通知<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202412/%E4%B8%9C%E8%8E%9E.png\" style=\"width: 1274px; height: 706px;\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">各有关单位：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">为指导我市建设工程建筑信息模型（<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>）应用，我局组织编制了《东莞市建筑工程<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术应用指南（试行）》，供建筑行业从业人员等学习使用。使用过程中如有意见或建议，请寄送至东莞市住房和城乡建设局（地址：东莞市东城街道莞龙路东城段<span lang=\"EN-US\">283</span>号，邮编<span lang=\"EN-US\">523112</span>，联系方式：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0769-22671650</span>），以便修改完善。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">附件：<a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202412/%E4%B8%9C%E8%8E%9E%E5%B8%82%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8BBIM%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%95%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%89.pdf\">东莞市建筑工程<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术应用指南（试行）</a><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">　　东莞市住房和城乡建设局<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">　　<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">27</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">（经办人：节能办</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">周工，联系电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">22671650</span>。）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}